      "line_0": {
        "id": "line_0",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "这是什么？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_0:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_1": {
        "id": "line_1",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "“当我醒来的时候……躺在黑色迷宫的地面上，失去了近期的记忆……同行的人中隐藏着一名嗜血的‘杀人鬼’……”",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_1:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_2": {
        "id": "line_2",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "听起来很刺激。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_2:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_3": {
        "id": "line_3",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "快来快来。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_3:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_3": {
        "id": "game_time_3",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_4": {
        "id": "line_4",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "*游戏进行中",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_4:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_5": {
        "id": "line_5",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "*游戏结束",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_5:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_6": {
        "id": "line_6",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "原来杀人魔是你。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_6:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_6": {
        "id": "game_time_6",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_7": {
        "id": "line_7",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "我死在你手里了，主控。鲜血直流的死状呢。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_7:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_8": {
        "id": "line_8",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "不要再说下去了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_8:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_9": {
        "id": "line_9",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "你伪装得太好我们都没认出来——成功卧底杀死所有人得感觉很爽吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_9:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_9": {
        "id": "game_time_9",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_10": {
        "id": "line_10",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "我不知道自己是杀人魔，也不想当杀人魔……一切都不是我的本意。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_10:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_11": {
        "id": "line_11",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "杀人魔都会这么说。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_11:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_12": {
        "id": "line_12",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "实际上是在暗爽吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_12:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_12": {
        "id": "game_time_12",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_13": {
        "id": "line_13",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "再开一局？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_13:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_14": {
        "id": "line_14",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "不要再说了！我不玩了，你们都要当杀人魔杀我——我不想被杀死，我不要被杀死……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_14:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_15": {
        "id": "line_15",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "这么入戏？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_15:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_15": {
        "id": "game_time_15",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_16": {
        "id": "line_16",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "小心今晚睡下去醒来就失去全部记忆躺在一个红房间里……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_16:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_17": {
        "id": "line_17",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "不要逗这个可怜人了，放他去刷题吧。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_17:continue"
        }
      },
      "streak_text1": {
        "id": "streak_text1",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "你都多久不跟我们一起玩了？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:streak_text1:continue"
        }
      },
      "streak_text2": {
        "id": "streak_text2",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "三天了。提高一分，干掉千人；在这三天里，我已经干掉了……大约五千人。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:streak_text2:continue"
        }
      },
      "streak_text3": {
        "id": "streak_text3",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "他居然计数。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:streak_text3:continue"
        }
      },
      "streak_text4": {
        "id": "streak_text4",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "这个精神状态已经很危险了。",
